            "toolchain": "Latest installed MSVC v143 (Visual Studio 2022 Build Tools), Release x64",
            "patches": [
              "PaddleOCR 3.7.0 src/utils/utility.cc includes <dirent.h>, which MSVC does not provide. The build adds the header-only MIT shim from https://github.com/tronkko/dirent/tree/1.24 to the include path (SHA-256 7383044a375d481ac8ad7ec2f43151263eca792f085001a8020cc590114a06a6).",
              "scripts/build-paddleocr-win-x64.ps1 redirects deploy/cpp_infer/CMakeLists.txt from its one-shot cli.cc entrypoint to paddleocr/worker/paddleocr_worker.cc, a GPL-3.0-or-later persistent JSONL worker for Kizuna protocol v1. The CMake target keeps its upstream name and the executable is renamed to paddleocr.exe when it is staged."
            ]
