          "name": "ppocr-japanese-models",
          "version": "PP-OCRv5",
          "license": "Apache-2.0",
          "source": {
            "url": "https://github.com/PaddlePaddle/PaddleOCR/blob/v3.7.0/docs/version3.x/model_list.md",
            "detectionArchiveUrl": "https://paddle-model-ecology.bj.bcebos.com/paddlex/official_inference_model/paddle3.0.0/PP-OCRv5_mobile_det_infer.tar",
            "detectionArchiveSha256": "50446e5d01ac2a73d5319c89513281f6578414c888c602f9af13f93feefffc58",
            "recognitionArchiveUrl": "https://paddle-model-ecology.bj.bcebos.com/paddlex/official_inference_model/paddle3.0.0/PP-OCRv5_mobile_rec_infer.tar",
            "recognitionArchiveSha256": "566b9512b34e34a9f0db54d87b51fa5a0b9ed2cf1ab7e49728cc0b8b5a64f414",
            "languageNote": "PP-OCRv5 recognition covers Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, English, Japanese, and Pinyin in one model; no Japanese-specific weight file exists for this generation. There is no separate character dictionary because PIR-format models embed it.",
            "selectionNote": "The all-mobile pair was chosen on measurement. Across four renderings of a 1920x1080 capture it read 19 of 20 Japanese lines at 1.6-2.0 s per frame; the server recognizer read 15 of 20 at 2.1-2.6 s. Detection is a flat ~0.5 s and recognition costs roughly 0.2 s per detected line, so latency tracks the amount of on-screen text rather than the capture resolution.",
            "alternatives": {
              "note": "The server recognizer is recorded only because it was the previously shipped choice; on the Japanese fixture it is both slower and less accurate than the mobile one. The server detector is roughly six times slower than the mobile detector and was never viable for the keypress target.",
              "serverDetectionArchiveUrl": "https://paddle-model-ecology.bj.bcebos.com/paddlex/official_inference_model/paddle3.0.0/PP-OCRv5_server_det_infer.tar",
              "serverDetectionArchiveSha256": "22a33e0ba6a21425ea4192da03bf4395c9a0c67902bd924b7328fc859073045d",
              "serverRecognitionArchiveUrl": "https://paddle-model-ecology.bj.bcebos.com/paddlex/official_inference_model/paddle3.0.0/PP-OCRv5_server_rec_infer.tar",
